cartridge "SEEDLINGS/AMY BIENVENU/2026"

' SEEDLINGS - an original rescue puzzle for the ColecoVision.
'
' Seedlings drop from the seed box and walk straight ahead, whatever is
' in front of them: they turn at walls, climb one step, fall down holes
' and drown in water (a fall of more than six cells is too much, too).
' Give them jobs to bring enough of them to the sunny door: DIG straight
' down through earth (not rock), STOP to stand and turn the others back,
' STEP to lay five bricks of stairs ahead. Eight gardens.
'
' House rules: joystick and button only; text in columns 2-29, rows 1-22;
' tiles from code 128 (art.py); an original tune played once (tune.py);
' the frame loop keeps the NMI off outside the wait (Frame1).
'
' Screen: row 1 the counters, rows 2-20 the garden (28 x 19 cells, in the
' name table itself: seed.asm reads and writes it), row 22 the jobs.
' Sprites are 8 x 8: sprite 0 is the pointer, 1-12 the seedlings.

